name issue_62_opus_fec_low_rate
describe issue_62_neteq_v2_audio_only_lossy at a 12 kbps Opus rate: libopus's decide_fec has no rate for LBRR there (issue #62)
duration 30s
video off
neteq v2
audio_rate 12kbps
at 0s capacity=500kbps delay=40ms jitter=10ms loss=10%
# At 12 kbps and 10% loss libopus codes wide band and decide_fec finds no
# bandwidth whose LBRR threshold the rate clears (NB needs 14941 bps of
# equivalent rate, this gives 10183), so no packet carries LBRR. Ours with the
# decision: concealed 0.84-1.44 % on seeds 1-5 (seed 1 1.07); with LBRR at any
# loss above 0 (before): 0.50-0.94 (seed 1 0.74).
expect audio.interruptions == 0
expect audio.concealed_pct >= 0.8
